ch03-3-4:
**证明：**

(1) 直线 $\ell_\varphi$ 的单位方向向量为 $\boldsymbol a=(\cos\varphi,\sin\varphi)^\top$，则 $\boldsymbol a\cdot\boldsymbol a=1$ 且对 $\boldsymbol v=(x,y)^\top$ 有 $\boldsymbol v\cdot\boldsymbol a=x\cos\varphi+y\sin\varphi$。代入镜像反射公式得
$$
\begin{aligned}
\boldsymbol{\psi}_\varphi\begin{pmatrix}x\\y\end{pmatrix}
&= 2(x\cos\varphi+y\sin\varphi)\begin{pmatrix}\cos\varphi\\\sin\varphi\end{pmatrix}-\begin{pmatrix}x\\y\end{pmatrix} \\
&= \begin{pmatrix}x(2\cos^2\varphi-1)+y(2\sin\varphi\cos\varphi)\\x(2\sin\varphi\cos\varphi)-y(2\cos^2\varphi-1)\end{pmatrix} \\
&= \begin{pmatrix}x\cos 2\varphi+y\sin 2\varphi\\x\sin 2\varphi-y\cos 2\varphi\end{pmatrix}.
\end{aligned}
$$

(2) 对任意 $(x,y)^\top\in\mathbb R^2$，计算复合得
$$
\begin{aligned}
(\boldsymbol{\psi}_\varphi\circ\boldsymbol{\psi}_\psi)\begin{pmatrix}x\\y\end{pmatrix}
&= \begin{pmatrix}(x\cos 2\psi+y\sin 2\psi)\cos 2\varphi+(x\sin 2\psi-y\cos 2\psi)\sin 2\varphi\\(x\cos 2\psi+y\sin 2\psi)\sin 2\varphi-(x\sin 2\psi-y\cos 2\psi)\cos 2\varphi\end{pmatrix} \\
&= \begin{pmatrix}x\cos 2(\varphi-\psi)-y\sin 2(\varphi-\psi)\\x\sin 2(\varphi-\psi)+y\cos 2(\varphi-\psi)\end{pmatrix}=\boldsymbol{\rho}_{2(\varphi-\psi)}\begin{pmatrix}x\\y\end{pmatrix}.
\end{aligned}
$$
对任意旋转变换 $\boldsymbol{\rho}_\theta$，取 $\psi=0$、$\varphi=\frac{\theta}{2}$ 即得 $\boldsymbol{\rho}_\theta=\boldsymbol{\psi}_{\theta/2}\circ\boldsymbol{\psi}_0$，故平面上每个旋转变换皆可写成两个镜面反射的复合。$\square$

